--- Peer as50r1 su as20r1: anteprima (1 file) ---
  as20r1/etc/frr/frr.conf
    + riga  22: 
    + riga  23: neighbor 192.168.0.10 prefix-list peer_as50r1_in in
    + riga  24: neighbor 192.168.0.10 prefix-list peer_as50r1_out out
    + riga  25: 
    + riga  26: ip prefix-list peer_as50r1_in permit any
    + riga  27: ip prefix-list peer_as50r1_out permit 20.0.0.0/8
    + riga  28: 

